# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">02</span><span class="sec-icon">🔐</span><h2>Least privilege in Unity Catalog</h2></div><div class="code"><div class="code-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="lang">SQL</span><button class="copy" type="button">copy</button></div><pre><span style="color: #FF7B72">GRANT</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">USE</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">CATALOG</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">ON</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">CATALOG</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">prod</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">TO</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">analysts</span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">;</span>
# MAGIC <span style="color: #FF7B72">GRANT</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">USE</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">SCHEMA</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">,</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">SELECT</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">ON</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">SCHEMA</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">prod.gold</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">TO</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">analysts</span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">;</span><span style="color: #6E7681">      </span><span style="color: #8B949E; font-style: italic">-- gold only, no raw PII</span>
# MAGIC <span style="color: #FF7B72">REVOKE</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">ALL</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">PRIVILEGES</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">ON</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">SCHEMA</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">prod.bronze</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">FROM</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">analysts</span><span style="color: #FF7B72; font-weight: bold">`</span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">;</span>
# MAGIC <span style="color: #FF7B72">SHOW</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">GRANTS</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">ON</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #FF7B72">SCHEMA</span><span style="color: #6E7681"> </span><span style="color: #E6EDF3">prod.gold;</span></pre></div>
# MAGIC <ul>
# MAGIC <li>Reading a table needs <strong>all three</strong>: <code>USE CATALOG</code>, <code>USE SCHEMA</code> and <code>SELECT</code>.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Grant to <strong>groups</strong>, run production as <strong>service principals</strong>, and keep raw PII in a <strong>restricted</strong> bronze schema.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Unity Catalog privileges are <strong>allow-only</strong> (there is no <code>DENY</code>), so restrict by granting narrowly.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Audit:</strong> <code>system.access.audit</code> and <strong>lineage</strong> show who read PII and where it flowed.</li>
# MAGIC </ul>
