# MAGIC <div class="dbx">
# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">04</span><span class="sec-icon">🎭</span><h2>De-identification methods</h2></div><div class="tbl"><table>
# MAGIC <thead>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <th>Method</th>
# MAGIC <th>Example</th>
# MAGIC <th>Reversible?</th>
# MAGIC <th>Still joinable?</th>
# MAGIC <th>Result</th>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </thead>
# MAGIC <tbody>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Hashing</strong> (salted / keyed)</td>
# MAGIC <td><code>sha2(concat(email, secret('pii','salt')), 256)</code></td>
# MAGIC <td>No</td>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Yes</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Pseudonymized</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Tokenization</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Random token, mapping kept in a locked <strong>vault table</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Yes</strong>, with vault access</td>
# MAGIC <td>Yes</td>
# MAGIC <td>Pseudonymized</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Generalization</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Age → <code>30-39</code>, ZIP → first 3 digits, date → month</td>
# MAGIC <td>No</td>
# MAGIC <td>Partly</td>
# MAGIC <td>Anonymized</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Suppression</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>Drop or NULL the column</td>
# MAGIC <td>No</td>
# MAGIC <td>No</td>
# MAGIC <td>Anonymized</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Masking</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td><code>***-**-1234</code> at query time</td>
# MAGIC <td>Original still stored</td>
# MAGIC <td>—</td>
# MAGIC <td>Access control</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>Text masking</td>
# MAGIC <td><code>ai_mask(comment, ARRAY('email', 'phone'))</code></td>
# MAGIC <td>No</td>
# MAGIC <td>—</td>
# MAGIC <td>PII in free text</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </tbody>
# MAGIC </table></div>
# MAGIC <ul>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Pseudonymized</strong> data is still <strong>personal data</strong> under GDPR, because re-identification is possible.</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Anonymized</strong> data (generalized, suppressed, aggregated) is no longer personal data, provided nobody can be re-identified. Think about <strong>k-anonymity</strong>: every combination of attributes should match at least <em>k</em> people.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Keep salts and keys in <strong>secrets</strong>. A plain <code>sha2(email)</code> is guessable.</li>
# MAGIC </ul>
# MAGIC </div>

