# MAGIC <li>Until <code>VACUUM</code>, deleted rows are still readable with <strong>time travel</strong> (<code>VERSION AS OF</code>).</li>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Downstream streaming tables</strong> fail on deletes in their source. Use <code>skipChangeCommits</code> plus DML on the target, or the <strong>change data feed</strong>.</li>
